  "methodology": [
    "Real Keycloak OIDC, server sessions, real PostgreSQL source scanning, API-backed fixture creation and canonical read-back assertions. No mocked identity, responses or source service.",
    "CI project ordering uses one worker with zero retries/skips. Automatic traces/video/screenshots are disabled; explicit captures contain authenticated synthetic data only.",
    "The new project reads actual rate-budget headers in beforeAll/beforeEach/afterAll. With fewer than 220 requests remaining it waits at most 61 seconds within a 75-second hook budget; production limits and all mutation/assertion semantics remain unchanged.",
    "Axe WCAG2A/2AA/2.1AA/2.2AA checks run after finite animations settle with no rule or element exclusions. Each captured viewport also checks document overflow.",
